# Audit follow-up 2026-06-01: Vercel invalidated its long-standing npm build
# cache and switched this project to pnpm. pnpm's default isolated (symlinked)
# node_modules left `next` unresolvable from packages/app, so Vercel's Next.js
# version probe failed ("No Next.js version detected") and the prod build
# errored. `node-linker=hoisted` lays out a flat, npm-style node_modules so
# `next` resolves exactly as it did under npm for months. The app code already
# ran under that fully-hoisted (npm) layout, so this only restores it.
node-linker=hoisted
